WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Start a fresh run and enter the Gateway.
This creates the first playable state.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Save the Gateway, then complete it.
Saving records progress before traversal continues.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Focus the Game view and press Up.
Keyboard focus moves to the available Route.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.500
Press Return to enter the Route.
The selected node becomes the current content.

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:34.300
Save the Route checkpoint, then complete it.
The checkpoint preserves the new progress.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:37.300
Enter the Landmark.
The completed Route unlocks its destination.

00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:42.300
Load the saved map and route.
The HUD shows the Route restored and Landmark locked.

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:46.300
Save the restored state, then exit Play Mode.
The captured runtime flow is complete.
